there are a considerable number of correlations which may be due to climate factors affecting processes (ex. iron accumulation in low precipitation sites). In writing consider that climate can be driving changes in soil which in turn may be driving changes in microbial communities. Climate can also be driving changes in microbial communities which may be driving changes in soil processes (ex. decomposition leading to different CN rates.)

